1
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:06,600
Ten minutes.

2
00:00:06,650 --> 00:00:11,040
That is all it takes now for milk, bread,
even a phone charger to reach your door,

3
00:00:11,090 --> 00:00:12,665
often before the kettle boils.

4
00:00:13,065 --> 00:00:19,897
Behind those ten minutes are two companies,
two apps, and a war that gets more

5
00:00:19,947 --> 00:00:22,456
expensive with every quarter.

6
00:00:22,856 --> 00:00:27,763
On Friday, the twenty-third of October,
Swiggy lost as much as sixteen percent of

7
00:00:27,813 --> 00:00:29,354
its value in a single day.

8
00:00:29,404 --> 00:00:32,842
It was the biggest one-day
fall in the company's history.

9
00:00:33,242 --> 00:00:38,242
That same week, its rival Blinkit, owned
by Eternal, reported a quick-commerce

10
00:00:38,292 --> 00:00:41,544
profit of one hundred and
eighty-four crore rupees.

11
00:00:41,594 --> 00:00:46,982
Both serve the same cities and the same
customers, with the same ten-minute promise.

12
00:00:47,382 --> 00:00:52,598
Swiggy's Instamart is losing about nine
point seven crore rupees every day.

13
00:00:52,648 --> 00:00:54,986
Blinkit is making about two crore.

14
00:00:55,036 --> 00:00:56,952
This film is about that gap.

15
00:00:57,352 --> 00:00:59,380
Ab is kahani ko shuru se samajhte
hain, aapki zubaan mein.

16
00:01:03,380 --> 00:01:05,817
Kahani khaane se shuru hoti hai.

17
00:01:05,867 --> 00:01:11,258
Zomato aur Swiggy, dono ne India ko
phone se khaana mangwana sikhaaya.

18
00:01:11,308 --> 00:01:14,444
Saalon tak dono ek hi race daud rahe the.

19
00:01:14,494 --> 00:01:18,486
Restaurant, delivery partner,
discount, aur nuksaan.

20
00:01:18,886 --> 00:01:21,576
Phir dono ne ek aur darwaaza khola.

21
00:01:21,626 --> 00:01:22,359
Groceries.

22
00:01:22,409 --> 00:01:26,742
Woh cheezein jo aap roz
khareedte hain, das minute mein.

23
00:01:26,792 --> 00:01:29,247
Swiggy ne apna Instamart banaya.

24
00:01:29,297 --> 00:01:35,744
Zomato ne 2022 mein Blinkit khareeda, jo
pehle Grofers tha, lagbhag ₹4,447 crore ki

25
00:01:35,794 --> 00:01:37,310
all-stock deal mein.

26
00:01:37,710 --> 00:01:40,263
Is business ka dil ek "dark store" hai.

27
00:01:40,313 --> 00:01:45,470
Ek chhota godown, aapke mohalle ke paas,
jahaan grahak kabhi andar nahi jaata.

28
00:01:45,520 --> 00:01:50,342
Sirf delivery partner jaata hai,
saamaan uthata hai, aur nikal jaata hai.

29
00:01:50,392 --> 00:01:53,279
Jitne zyada dark store,
utni jaldi delivery.

30
00:01:53,329 --> 00:01:57,818
Aur jitna zyada ek store bechta hai,
utna sasta har order padta hai.

31
00:01:58,218 --> 00:02:03,149
Is video mein do shabd baar baar aayenge,
toh pehle inhe samajh lete hain.

32
00:02:03,199 --> 00:02:07,188
GOV matlab grahak ne jitne ka
order kiya, discount se pehle.

33
00:02:07,238 --> 00:02:10,082
NOV matlab discount ke
baad ka order value.

34
00:02:10,132 --> 00:02:15,669
Dono companies yeh thoda alag tareeke se
ginti hain, isliye jahaan farak padta hai,

35
00:02:15,719 --> 00:02:17,823
wahaan hum screen pe likh denge.

36
00:02:18,223 --> 00:02:22,799
Aaj in do companies ki keemat
mein bahut bada farak hai.

37
00:02:22,849 --> 00:02:27,013
Eternal ka market cap
lagbhag ₹3.06 lakh crore hai.

38
00:02:27,063 --> 00:02:29,656
Swiggy ka lagbhag ₹48,600 crore.

39
00:02:29,706 --> 00:02:33,539
Eternal ki value Swiggy
se 6 guna se zyada hai.

40
00:02:33,939 --> 00:02:38,809
Do companies, ek hi cheez bechti
hain, aur keemat mein 6 guna ka farak.

41
00:02:38,859 --> 00:02:42,482
Is farak ki wajah Q2 ke
numbers mein saaf dikhti hai.

42
00:02:46,482 --> 00:02:50,526
Pehle sirf quick commerce
ki baat karte hain.

43
00:02:50,576 --> 00:02:56,713
July se September 2026 tak, Blinkit
pe ₹20,940 crore ke orders aaye.

44
00:02:56,763 --> 00:02:59,351
Instamart pe ₹6,594 crore ke.

45
00:02:59,751 --> 00:03:04,130
Yaani Blinkit ka business Instamart
se lagbhag 3.2 guna bada hai.

46
00:03:04,180 --> 00:03:07,129
Aur yeh bada business
bhi tez badh raha hai.

47
00:03:07,179 --> 00:03:10,059
Sirf pichhle quarter
ke muqable 22 percent.

48
00:03:10,459 --> 00:03:11,682
Stores dekhiye.

49
00:03:11,732 --> 00:03:14,992
Blinkit ke paas 2,751 dark stores hain.

50
00:03:15,042 --> 00:03:17,962
Is quarter mein usne 308 naye joda.

51
00:03:18,012 --> 00:03:24,921
Instamart ke paas 1,240 hain, aur usne 69
naye joda, jo uske pichhle teen quarters

52
00:03:24,971 --> 00:03:26,958
ke total ke barabar hai.

53
00:03:27,358 --> 00:03:28,615
Ab naksha dekhiye.

54
00:03:28,665 --> 00:03:34,568
Ek independent tracker, QuickCommerceMap,
ne July 2026 mein desh ke das sabse bade

55
00:03:34,618 --> 00:03:36,601
shehron ke dark stores gine.

56
00:03:36,651 --> 00:03:42,482
Blinkit aur Instamart ki seedhi takkar
mein, das mein se nau shehron mein Blinkit

57
00:03:42,532 --> 00:03:43,135
aage hai.

58
00:03:43,185 --> 00:03:47,636
Instamart sirf Chennai mein aage
hai, 67 stores ke muqable 62.

59
00:03:47,686 --> 00:03:51,339
Sabse bada farak Delhi mein
hai, 171 ke muqable 63.

60
00:03:51,739 --> 00:03:53,939
Aur yeh do companies akeli nahi hain.

61
00:03:53,989 --> 00:03:58,925
Poore market ko dekhein toh Hyderabad aur
Chennai mein Zepto ka network sabse bada

62
00:03:58,975 --> 00:04:03,668
hai, Kolkata mein Flipkart Minutes ka,
aur baaki saat shehron mein Blinkit ka.

63
00:04:04,068 --> 00:04:05,767
Ab sabse zaroori number.

64
00:04:05,817 --> 00:04:08,463
Har store, har din, kitna bechta hai.

65
00:04:08,863 --> 00:04:15,571
Blinkit ka ek store, average, har din
lagbhag ₹8.3 lakh ka saamaan bechta hai.

66
00:04:15,621 --> 00:04:19,296
Instamart ka ek store
lagbhag ₹5.8 lakh ka.

67
00:04:19,696 --> 00:04:23,323
Dark store ka kiraya, bijli,
staff, sab fixed hai.

68
00:04:23,373 --> 00:04:28,104
Isliye jo store zyada bechta hai,
uska har order sasta padta hai.

69
00:04:28,504 --> 00:04:29,284
Ab profit.

70
00:04:29,334 --> 00:04:34,017
Har ₹100 ke order pe Blinkit
lagbhag 88 paise kamata hai.

71
00:04:34,067 --> 00:04:38,832
Instamart har ₹100 ke order pe
lagbhag ₹13.60 ganwata hai.

72
00:04:39,232 --> 00:04:43,409
Blinkit ka margin lagaatar chhe
quarter se behtar ho raha hai.

73
00:04:43,459 --> 00:04:47,568
Saal bhar pehle yahi business
₹156 crore ke nuksaan mein tha.

74
00:04:47,968 --> 00:04:51,267
88 paise sunne mein chhota lagta hai.

75
00:04:51,317 --> 00:04:57,966
Lekin ₹20,940 crore ke orders pe, wohi
88 paise ₹184 crore ban jaate hain.

76
00:04:58,016 --> 00:05:02,854
Aur Instamart ka nuksaan,
₹895 crore, ek quarter mein.

77
00:05:03,254 --> 00:05:05,050
Instamart ki growth tez hai.

78
00:05:05,100 --> 00:05:10,258
Uske orders saal bhar mein 31 percent
badhe, aur pichhle quarter se 13 percent.

79
00:05:10,308 --> 00:05:14,411
Swiggy ne kaha ki yeh woh growth
hai jiska usne vaada kiya tha.

80
00:05:14,461 --> 00:05:17,971
Dikkat yeh hai ki har order
abhi bhi nuksaan mein hai.

81
00:05:21,971 --> 00:05:26,930
Swiggy ki kahani mein ek achhi khabar
bhi hai, aur woh khaane se aati hai.

82
00:05:26,980 --> 00:05:32,210
Swiggy ka food delivery business is
quarter apne itihaas ka sabse zyada profit

83
00:05:32,260 --> 00:05:32,617
laaya.

84
00:05:32,667 --> 00:05:37,761
₹341 crore adjusted EBITDA, yaani rozmarra
ke kaam se hone wala profit, kuch

85
00:05:37,811 --> 00:05:39,792
accounting items ko chhod kar.

86
00:05:40,192 --> 00:05:45,636
Swiggy pe har mahine lagbhag 1 crore 98
lakh log khaana mangwaate hain, aur yeh

87
00:05:45,686 --> 00:05:48,278
ginti saal bhar mein 15 percent badhi.

88
00:05:48,678 --> 00:05:53,276
Swiggy ne Toing naam ka ek alag app
bhi banaaya hai, saste khaane ke liye.

89
00:05:53,326 --> 00:05:55,349
Yeh 50 se zyada shehron mein hai.

90
00:05:55,399 --> 00:06:00,436
Company ke mutaabik Toing ke har teen naye
users mein se do ne pehle kabhi online

91
00:06:00,486 --> 00:06:02,258
khaana mangwaaya hi nahi tha.

92
00:06:02,658 --> 00:06:05,955
Zomato ka food delivery
bhi tez chal raha hai.

93
00:06:06,005 --> 00:06:10,249
Uske orders 21.5 percent badhe,
aur margin 5.5 percent hai.

94
00:06:10,649 --> 00:06:16,034
Chaar saal mein Zomato ka food business
dugna ho gaya, ₹18,160 crore se ₹37,993

95
00:06:16,084 --> 00:06:16,447
crore.

96
00:06:16,497 --> 00:06:19,336
Aur Eternal ne ek dilchasp baat maani hai.

97
00:06:19,386 --> 00:06:24,634
Pichhle saal food ki growth thodi dheemi
hui, kyunki kuch log jo pehle khaana

98
00:06:24,684 --> 00:06:28,761
mangwaate the, ab wahi zaroorat
Blinkit se poori karne lage.

99
00:06:28,811 --> 00:06:33,302
Yaani Blinkit ne kuch hissa apne
hi ghar ke food business se liya.

100
00:06:33,352 --> 00:06:36,673
Eternal ke mutaabik ab
yeh badlaav tham gaya hai.

101
00:06:37,073 --> 00:06:40,966
Swiggy apna margin GOV pe
batata hai, aur Zomato NOV pe.

102
00:06:41,016 --> 00:06:46,527
GOV discount se pehle ka number hai, toh
dono margins seedha compare nahi hote.

103
00:06:46,577 --> 00:06:48,217
Lekin ek cheez saaf hai.

104
00:06:48,267 --> 00:06:52,089
Dono ke liye khaana ab paisa
kamaane wala business hai.

105
00:06:52,489 --> 00:06:54,688
Ab Swiggy ki problem dekhiye.

106
00:06:54,738 --> 00:06:56,938
Khaana ₹341 crore kamata hai.

107
00:06:56,988 --> 00:06:59,498
Instamart ₹895 crore ganwata hai.

108
00:06:59,548 --> 00:07:04,617
Ek business ki kamaai doosre ka
aadha nuksaan bhi nahi bhar paati.

109
00:07:04,667 --> 00:07:08,961
Bacha hua gap, ₹554 crore,
sirf in do businesses ka hai.

110
00:07:09,361 --> 00:07:10,566
Eternal mein ulta hai.

111
00:07:10,616 --> 00:07:15,188
Wahaan khaana bhi kamata hai, aur Blinkit
bhi ab kamata hai, toh dono business ek

112
00:07:15,238 --> 00:07:16,728
hi taraf kheench rahe hain.

113
00:07:20,728 --> 00:07:23,958
Is jung ka ek bada mod
saamaan ki ownership hai.

114
00:07:24,008 --> 00:07:28,468
Dark store mein rakha saamaan kiska
hai, app ka ya kisi seller ka.

115
00:07:28,868 --> 00:07:33,543
India ke foreign investment rules ke hisaab
se, jis company mein videshi hissedari

116
00:07:33,593 --> 00:07:37,173
zyada hai, woh online khud ka
saamaan rakh kar nahi bech sakti.

117
00:07:37,223 --> 00:07:41,380
Woh sirf ek marketplace ban sakti hai,
jahaan doosre sellers bechte hain.

118
00:07:41,780 --> 00:07:44,629
2025 mein Eternal ne ek bada faisla liya.

119
00:07:44,679 --> 00:07:50,357
Usne apni videshi hissedari 49.5 percent
pe rok di, taaki woh ek Indian-owned and

120
00:07:50,407 --> 00:07:52,337
controlled company ban sake.

121
00:07:52,387 --> 00:07:56,863
Iske baad Blinkit khud saamaan
khareed kar, khud bech sakta tha.

122
00:07:56,913 --> 00:07:59,692
September 2025 se yeh badlaav shuru hua.

123
00:08:00,092 --> 00:08:06,721
Isi wajah se Eternal ka revenue ek saal
mein 77.6 percent badha, ₹13,590 crore se

124
00:08:06,771 --> 00:08:07,876
₹24,138 crore.

125
00:08:07,926 --> 00:08:14,226
Kyunki ab Blinkit poore saamaan ki keemat
apne revenue mein dikhata hai, sirf

126
00:08:14,276 --> 00:08:15,545
commission nahi.

127
00:08:15,945 --> 00:08:20,819
Khud ka saamaan rakhne ka matlab hai behtar
daam pe khareedna, behtar margin, aur

128
00:08:20,869 --> 00:08:24,041
zyada control ki kaun sa
product kis store mein rahe.

129
00:08:24,091 --> 00:08:25,987
Sellers ke liye bhi niyam badle.

130
00:08:26,037 --> 00:08:31,033
Blinkit ne unse naye model mein aane ko
kaha, aur jo nahi aaye, unki listing hatane

131
00:08:31,083 --> 00:08:31,823
ki baat kahi.

132
00:08:32,223 --> 00:08:32,772
Ab Swiggy.

133
00:08:32,822 --> 00:08:37,739
Is quarter Swiggy ne bataya ki use bhi
Indian-owned and controlled company banne ki

134
00:08:37,789 --> 00:08:41,450
zaroori manzoori mil gayi hai,
aur badlaav shuru ho chuka hai.

135
00:08:41,850 --> 00:08:48,101
Matlab jo raasta Blinkit ne 2025 mein liya,
Swiggy us pe ab chal raha hai, lagbhag

136
00:08:48,151 --> 00:08:49,100
ek saal baad.

137
00:08:49,500 --> 00:08:52,999
Aur quick commerce mein ek
saal bahut lamba waqt hai.

138
00:08:53,049 --> 00:08:58,423
Is ek saal mein Blinkit ne stores joda,
suppliers ke saath rishte banaaye, aur ab

139
00:08:58,473 --> 00:09:00,700
har quarter profit dikha raha hai.

140
00:09:04,700 --> 00:09:09,028
Results Thursday, 22 October ko
market band hone ke baad aaye.

141
00:09:09,078 --> 00:09:12,770
Friday ko market khula, aur
share seedha neeche gaya.

142
00:09:13,170 --> 00:09:17,784
Swiggy ka IPO November 2024
mein ₹390 pe aaya tha.

143
00:09:17,834 --> 00:09:21,422
Aaj share lagbhag ₹176 ke aas paas hai.

144
00:09:21,472 --> 00:09:25,060
IPO price se lagbhag 55 percent neeche.

145
00:09:25,460 --> 00:09:27,332
Market ne kya dekha.

146
00:09:27,382 --> 00:09:31,079
Revenue 36 percent badha, ₹7,571 crore.

147
00:09:31,129 --> 00:09:38,670
Lekin kul nuksaan pichhle quarter ke ₹791
crore se badh kar ₹922 crore ho gaya.

148
00:09:39,070 --> 00:09:43,988
Instamart ka contribution margin, yaani
har order pe store ke level ka hisaab,

149
00:09:44,038 --> 00:09:45,899
pichhle quarter se kamzor hua.

150
00:09:45,949 --> 00:09:50,868
Aur Instamart ne is ek quarter mein utne
naye stores khole, jitne pichhle teen

151
00:09:50,918 --> 00:09:52,970
quarters mein mila kar khole the.

152
00:09:53,370 --> 00:09:55,818
Aur ek lambi tasveer bhi hai.

153
00:09:55,868 --> 00:10:02,968
Financial year 2020 se ab tak, Swiggy ka
kul nuksaan lagbhag ₹24,679 crore ho chuka

154
00:10:03,018 --> 00:10:03,313
hai.

155
00:10:03,713 --> 00:10:07,556
Is nuksaan ko chalaane
ke liye paisa chahiye.

156
00:10:07,606 --> 00:10:14,563
Financial year 2026 mein Swiggy ke paas
fundraising aur financing se ₹9,397 crore

157
00:10:14,613 --> 00:10:19,754
aaye, jabki uske business
operations ne ₹2,898 crore khaaye.

158
00:10:19,804 --> 00:10:25,983
March 2026 tak uske paas lagbhag
₹10,077 crore cash aur investments the.

159
00:10:26,383 --> 00:10:32,304
23 October ko investors ki chinta yeh thi
ki yeh nuksaan kab tak chalega, aur kitna

160
00:10:32,354 --> 00:10:32,951
aur hoga.

161
00:10:33,001 --> 00:10:37,339
Share ka ek din mein 16 percent
girna isi chinta ka asar tha.

162
00:10:41,339 --> 00:10:43,582
Eternal ki apni kamzoriyaan bhi hain.

163
00:10:43,982 --> 00:10:44,747
Pehli baat.

164
00:10:44,797 --> 00:10:48,156
Blinkit ka profit margin
sirf 0.9 percent hai.

165
00:10:48,206 --> 00:10:53,862
Ek chhoti si galti, ek price war, aur
yeh profit wapas nuksaan ban sakta hai.

166
00:10:54,262 --> 00:10:54,726
Doosri.

167
00:10:54,776 --> 00:11:00,015
Eternal ka kul profit ₹125 crore tha,
lekin tax lagbhag 61 percent laga.

168
00:11:00,065 --> 00:11:05,819
Kyunki purane nuksaan pe jo tax ki chhoot
milti thi, woh ab khatam ho gayi hai.

169
00:11:06,219 --> 00:11:08,995
Aur growth ki raftaar
bhi thodi dheemi hui hai.

170
00:11:09,045 --> 00:11:13,985
Blinkit ke orders ab saal bhar mein 79
percent badh rahe hain, jo pehle se kam hai,

171
00:11:14,035 --> 00:11:16,269
kyunki base ab bahut bada ho gaya hai.

172
00:11:16,319 --> 00:11:21,139
Company ne agle teen saal ke liye 60
percent saalaana growth ka target rakha hai,

173
00:11:21,189 --> 00:11:24,205
aur kehti hai ki woh abhi
us se aage chal rahi hai.

174
00:11:24,605 --> 00:11:25,121
Teesri.

175
00:11:25,171 --> 00:11:31,669
Blinkit March 2027 tak 3,500 aur March
2028 tak lagbhag 5,000 stores ka plan bana

176
00:11:31,719 --> 00:11:32,396
raha hai.

177
00:11:32,446 --> 00:11:37,812
Naye stores shuru mein kam bechte
hain, aur unmein paisa lagta hai.

178
00:11:38,212 --> 00:11:38,910
Aur chauthi.

179
00:11:38,960 --> 00:11:40,966
Yeh do companies akeli nahi hain.

180
00:11:41,016 --> 00:11:45,016
Zepto, Flipkart aur Amazon bhi
das minute ka vaada kar rahe hain.

181
00:11:45,066 --> 00:11:50,125
Blinkit ne khud likha hai ki jin shehron
mein muqabla zyada hai, wahaan ka unhe ab

182
00:11:50,175 --> 00:11:51,309
behtar andaaza hai.

183
00:11:51,709 --> 00:11:54,352
Phir bhi ek number
Blinkit ke paksh mein hai.

184
00:11:54,402 --> 00:11:58,901
Uske mature shehron mein margin 5 percent
se upar hai, aur jin shehron se 70

185
00:11:58,951 --> 00:12:03,031
percent business aata hai, woh
adjusted EBITDA mein profit mein hain.

186
00:12:07,031 --> 00:12:10,345
Agle results mein teen number
dekhiye, aur ek bonus.

187
00:12:10,745 --> 00:12:10,890
Ek.

188
00:12:10,940 --> 00:12:13,032
Instamart ka contribution margin.

189
00:12:13,082 --> 00:12:18,357
Agar yeh zero ke upar jaata hai, toh har
order kam se kam store ke level pe kamane

190
00:12:18,407 --> 00:12:18,811
lagega.

191
00:12:19,211 --> 00:12:19,367
Do.

192
00:12:19,417 --> 00:12:21,289
Har store, har din ki bikri.

193
00:12:21,339 --> 00:12:26,919
Jab tak Instamart ka store Blinkit ke store
jitna nahi bechta, nuksaan ka gap bana

194
00:12:26,969 --> 00:12:27,400
rahega.

195
00:12:27,800 --> 00:12:28,083
Teen.

196
00:12:28,133 --> 00:12:33,350
Instamart ka inventory model kitni jaldi
chalu hota hai, aur usse margin pe kya

197
00:12:33,400 --> 00:12:34,350
asar padta hai.

198
00:12:34,750 --> 00:12:37,237
Aur ek bonus number, Blinkit ka margin.

199
00:12:37,287 --> 00:12:42,637
Kya naye stores kholte hue bhi yeh 0.9
percent se upar jaata hai, jaisa company keh

200
00:12:42,687 --> 00:12:43,223
rahi hai.

201
00:12:47,123 --> 00:12:51,910
Every night, in nearly four thousand dark
stores run by these two companies alone,

202
00:12:51,960 --> 00:12:55,214
shelves are restocked for
tomorrow's ten-minute promise.

203
00:12:55,614 --> 00:12:57,846
Both companies keep that promise.

204
00:12:57,896 --> 00:13:02,549
Instamart pays about nine point
seven crore rupees a day to keep it.

205
00:13:02,599 --> 00:13:04,624
Blinkit earns about two crore.

206
00:13:05,024 --> 00:13:09,743
Over the next few quarters, those two
numbers will decide how this war ends.

207
00:13:09,793 --> 00:13:13,319
Watch the store, the margin,
and the switch to inventory.

208
00:13:13,369 --> 00:13:16,268
The answers will be in
the next set of results.

209
00:13:16,668 --> 00:13:17,798
This was AVRON.

210
00:13:17,848 --> 00:13:19,922
The story behind the stock.
